    affiliation: "Texas A&M University"
    email: tcokyasar@tamu.edu
keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - scholarly writing
  - large language models
  - OpenAlex
  - interrupted time series
abstract: >-
  Code and data that build a corpus of 1.84 million research articles from 256
  engineering journals (2015-2025) from OpenAlex, recover missing abstracts, measure
  word use in abstracts and in a sample of full texts, and estimate departures from
  pre-2023 trends after the release of ChatGPT.
repository-code: "https://github.com/tcokyasar44/What_changed_in_engineering_writing_after_AI"
